<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: 微软雅黑; vertical-align: -0.5pt; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">拟录取硕士研究生调档函及</span><span style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16pt;">录取通知书通讯地址确认系统操作流程</span><br></p>
<section class="docx">
 <article>
  <p style="line-height: 1.02; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p>
  <p class="docx_2" style="margin-top: 4.55pt; line-height: 0.9; margin-left: 2.15pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">一、系统登录</span></p>
  <p class="docx_2" style="margin-top: 14.9pt; line-height: 1.66; text-indent: 28.4pt; margin-left: 0.8pt; margin-right: 11pt;">请使用谷歌浏览器进行系统操作。（ 谷歌浏览器下载地址： <span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">https://www.google.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">cn/chrome/index.html</span>）</p>
  <p class="docx_2" style="margin-top: 1.9pt; line-height: 1.66; text-indent: 29.4pt; margin-left: 0.85pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">1.</span>考生进入西安电子科技大学研究生招生服务平台，通过输入网 &nbsp;址（<span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">https://yjspt.xidian.edu.cn/gsapp/sys/wdyjsbm/entrance.do</span>），或打开 &nbsp;研究生院官网（<span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">https://gr.xidian.edu.cn/</span>）点击“研究生招生服务平台” 实现跳转。</p>
  <p style="text-align:center"><span style="vertical-align: -37.5pt;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 415.25pt; height: 188.6pt;"><img src="/__local/6/6B/E6/E51A7005C7B629E4DB28BFCB5BF_D60EF9AA_5EC5.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/66BE6E51A7005C7B629E4DB28BFCB5BF/D60EF9AA/5EC5" vheight=" 188.6pt" vwidth=" 415.3pt" orisrc="/__local/6/6B/E6/E51A7005C7B629E4DB28BFCB5BF_D60EF9AA_5EC5.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 415.3pt; height: 188.6pt;"></span></span></p>
  <p class="docx_2" style="margin-top: 15.9pt; line-height: 1.65; text-indent: 27.5pt; margin-left: 1.4pt; margin-right: 7.05pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">2.</span>选择本年度硕士招生模块，例：“<span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-weight: bold;">2024 </span><span style="font-weight: bold;">年硕士招生</span>”。进入页面 后使用账号密码进行登录。</p>
  <p style="line-height: 1.65; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p>
 </article>
</section>
<section class="docx">
 <article>
  <p style="text-align:center"><span style="vertical-align: -39.5pt;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 415.25pt; height: 198.75pt;"><img src="/__local/5/B6/51/6A2BE3E96AE7AF96BE244F16B37_724C759D_5172.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/5B6516A2BE3E96AE7AF96BE244F16B37/724C759D/5172" vheight=" 198.8pt" vwidth=" 415.3pt" orisrc="/__local/5/B6/51/6A2BE3E96AE7AF96BE244F16B37_724C759D_5172.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 415.3pt; height: 198.8pt;"></span></span></p>
  <p class="docx_2" style="margin-top: 10.85pt; line-height: 1.65; text-indent: 27.8pt; margin-left: 1.4pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">3.</span>首次登录输入本人身份证号并点击右侧<span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">“</span>确认<span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">”</span>键，系统将自动 匹配初始报名号（<span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">推免生无报名号，系统匹配本人 </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">1</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">5</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">位考生编号</span>）， 登录密码为本人考生编号。申请初试成绩复核时进行密码修改的，按 照修改后的密码登录。</p>
  <p style="text-align:center"><span style="vertical-align: -39pt;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 415.25pt; height: 195.1pt;"><img src="/__local/2/EF/54/184AA278F7CA5CE222A4FA4BAAD_D32D172F_787B.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/2EF54184AA278F7CA5CE222A4FA4BAAD/D32D172F/787B" vheight=" 195.1pt" vwidth=" 415.3pt" orisrc="/__local/2/EF/54/184AA278F7CA5CE222A4FA4BAAD_D32D172F_787B.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 415.3pt; height: 195.1pt;"></span></span></p>
  <p class="docx_2" style="margin-top: 12.65pt; line-height: 1.68; text-indent: 27.8pt; margin-left: 1.1pt; margin-right: 3.6pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">4.</span>忘记密码或修改密码，请点击忘记密码。修改密码时请输入证 件号码、手机号、验证码， 点击下一步，根据提示的密码规则，输入 新密码（<span style="font-weight: bold;">密码请不要设置为连续数字</span>），点击下一步，修改密码完成。 密码修改完成后自动跳转进入登录系统。</p>
  <p style="line-height: 1.68; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p>
 </article>
</section>
<section class="docx">
 <article>
  <p style="text-align:center"><span style="vertical-align: -39pt;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 415.25pt; height: 195.1pt;"><img src="/__local/A/C4/BC/3A96A344EC4CA17B8B962FB898F_E386526B_787D.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/AC4BC3A96A344EC4CA17B8B962FB898F/E386526B/787D" vheight=" 195.1pt" vwidth=" 415.3pt" orisrc="/__local/A/C4/BC/3A96A344EC4CA17B8B962FB898F_E386526B_787D.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 415.3pt; height: 195.1pt;"></span></span></p>
  <p class="docx_2" style="margin-top: 12.45pt; line-height: 0.9; margin-left: 2pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">二、功能选择</span></p>
  <p class="docx_2" style="margin-top: 14.8pt; line-height: 1.65; text-indent: 27.8pt; margin-left: 2.45pt; margin-right: 0.5pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">1.</span>登录后选择材料打印模块进行<span style="font-weight: bold;">调档函打印</span>。<span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">注意，只能在要求</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">的时间范围内才可以打印调档函。</span></p>
  <p style="text-align:center"><span style="vertical-align: -15.5pt;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 415.25pt; height: 79.2pt;"><img src="/__local/2/8F/9E/5A22F24BFC954788FC107D04240_B7353D0D_19BA.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/28F9E5A22F24BFC954788FC107D04240/B7353D0D/19BA" vheight=" 79.2pt" vwidth=" 415.3pt" orisrc="/__local/2/8F/9E/5A22F24BFC954788FC107D04240_B7353D0D_19BA.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 415.3pt; height: 79.2pt;"></span></span></p>
  <p class="docx_2" style="margin-top: 16.05pt; line-height: 1.65; text-indent: 27.05pt; margin-left: 1.85pt; margin-right: 0.5pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">2.</span>登录后选择录取信息模块进行<span style="font-weight: bold;">通讯信息确认</span>。<span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">注意，只能在要</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">求的时间范围内进行通讯信息确认。</span></p>
  <p style="text-align:center"><span style="vertical-align: -46.5pt;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 415.25pt; height: 233.55pt;"><img src="/__local/3/AA/87/E31188A1E5265130E1151B2B4C8_7B16838C_980C.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/3AA87E31188A1E5265130E1151B2B4C8/7B16838C/980C" vheight=" 233.6pt" vwidth=" 415.3pt" orisrc="/__local/3/AA/87/E31188A1E5265130E1151B2B4C8_7B16838C_980C.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 415.3pt; height: 233.6pt;"></span></span></p>
  <p style="text-align: left;"><span style="text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>
  <p style="text-align: left;"><span style="text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"> &nbsp; <span style="text-indent: 0pt; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 18px;">3.</span></span><span style="text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; text-align: right;">确认信息无误后选择取件方式： 自取或者邮寄，勾选后提交。</span><br></p>
 </article>
</section>
<section class="docx">
 <article>
  <p style="line-height: 1.17; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p>
  <p style="text-align:center"><span style="vertical-align: -46.5pt;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 415.25pt; height: 233.6pt;"><img src="/__local/6/10/C0/2BE66E5A1813E49EBF5F7A3FBE5_4160156E_38C9.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/610C02BE66E5A1813E49EBF5F7A3FBE5/4160156E/38C9" vheight=" 233.6pt" vwidth=" 415.3pt" orisrc="/__local/6/10/C0/2BE66E5A1813E49EBF5F7A3FBE5_4160156E_38C9.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 415.3pt; height: 233.6pt;"></span></span></p>
 </article>
</section>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
</div></p>
 </div>
